{"format":"helia-content","version":1,"id":"schanuel-topos","title":{"Inline":[{"Text":"The Schanuel Topos"}]},"title_text":"The Schanuel Topos","kind":"definition","taxon":null,"url":"schanuel-topos.html","content":{"Block":[{"Group":{"role":"env","attrs":[["entry","schanuel-topos"],["kind","definition"],["label","Definition"],["numbered","true"]],"body":{"Block":[{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"Let "},{"Math":{"src":"bb(I)"}},{"Text":" be the category of finite sets and injections. The "},{"Emph":[{"Text":"Schanuel topos"}]},{"Text":" is the category of pullback-preserving functors "},{"Math":{"src":"bb(I)^\"op\" -> bold(\"Set\")"}},{"Text":"."}]},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"Equivalently, it is the category of "},{"EntryLink":{"id":"nominal-set","label":null,"body":[{"Text":"nominal sets"}]}},{"Text":", which are sets equipped with an action by the group of permutations on a countable set of names "},{"Math":{"src":"bb(A)"}},{"Text":", such that every element has finite support."}]}]}}}]}}
